> Setup wizard: a step-by-step installer that tours Termplate's features.
> The wizard's pages are modals on a stack: Next opens the next page, Esc
> goes back, and `close` closes them all. The installer writes only to its
> target folder (by default under $TMPDIR).
>
>   termplate run examples/wizard/app.termplate

app WIZARD
- termplate 0.1
- layout MAIN
- language en
- start INIT

include ui/*
include text/*

vars
- NAME text
- EMAIL text
- PASSWORD text
- EDITION choice basic standard pro default standard
- WORKERS number 2 range 1..8
- VERBOSE bool false
- THEME text "ocean"
- THEME_ROW number 1 range 1..2
- THEME_COL number 1 range 1..3
- TARGET text
- PARTS list
